error[E1002]: `r` goes `mut` in a call evaluated while `r.a` is lent `mut`
  --> mem:///main.lu:12:29
   |
12 |     take2(mut r.a, wipe(mut r))
   |               --- `r.a` is passed `mut` here
   |                             ^ a second claim inside the outer call's extent
   |
   = note: `r.a` and `r` are a path and its prefix [mem.model.path.disjoint]. A `mut` argument is
     exclusive for the whole call, and the arguments after it are evaluated inside that claim
     [mem.tier0.excl]. Evaluate the inner call into a local BEFORE the outer one.
